// wave_defense stress fixture (task #243): monster AOE attack.
//
// `damage <amount> in spread(radius, max_targets)` lowers via the
// `damage` arm + Spread area shape (ShapeKind=4). The runtime opts
// into AOE Path B via `LowerOpts.aoe_dispatch=true` so the apply_ability
// dispatcher walks the 27-cell neighborhood of the cast center,
// collects in-radius candidates (capped at the bitonic-sort scratch's
// 256-slot ceiling), bitonic-sorts by AgentId ascending, and emits one
// EffectDamageApplied chronicle record per kept slot.
//
// The .sim's MonsterCleaveScan @phase(per_agent) physics rule iterates
// each monster's nearby spatial neighbors and dispatches
// `apply_ability 1 by self target other` for each settler candidate;
// the dispatcher walks Spread from `agent_pos[other]` (= the picked
// settler's pos) — friendly-fire to other settlers in radius is by
// design (matches duel_25v25's Cleave behavior).
//
// `cooldown: 500ms` (5 ticks) matches the .sim's
// `monster_cooldown` config value so the cooldown gate stays in the
// per-rule `where` clause and the registry's program.cooldown_ticks
// field is informational only (today's GPU dispatcher does not consult
// it — same caveat as duel_25v25's Strike).

ability MonsterCleave {
    target: enemy
    range: 6.0
    cooldown: 500ms
    hint: damage

    damage 10.0 in spread(8.0, 16) [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
